[scene name="sponza" version=1]
; The arc-closing Sponza regression scene, saved from the editor 2026-08-17 with
; the DDGI volume at the MEASURED reference-parity point: Intensity 2.5,
; SkyIntensity 2, Hysteresis 0.6,
; divisions 16, rays 64, ClassifyStrength 0, single grid — the values that match
; the live speedball-gi demo's fill ratio, NOT a numeric copy of its panel
; (its giIntensity is demo-unit scaled; see the changelog's calibration note).
;
; The Sponza model itself is NOT committed (licensing:
; ThirdParty/SpeedballSponzaTestScene/UPSTREAM.md) — fetch it locally per that
; notice. Material/mesh guids below bind to the local import that authored this
; scene; a fresh import mints new guids, so rebind (or re-drag the model) after
; fetching rather than expecting these references to resolve on their own.













